00:28:59.821 --> 00:29:02.240
You got till tomorrow to think it over and let me know.

00:29:09.623 --> 00:29:11.750
If you don't talk, I'm really gonna kill them all.

00:29:13.502 --> 00:29:15.836
Starting with your girlfriend. :cue

